{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01388",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 5.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Come in, have a seat by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 6.91,
      "end_seconds": 12.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.16,
      "end_seconds": 19.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them. How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 19.79,
      "end_seconds": 27.83,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "It's sharp pain when I breathe in, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.71,
      "end_seconds": 35.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "When did this begin? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.12,
      "end_seconds": 45.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Um, for five days, I'd say. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.81,
      "end_seconds": 52.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.38,
      "end_seconds": 60.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "well, it happens all the time it's worse with deep breaths. Moderate, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.75,
      "end_seconds": 64.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.27,
      "end_seconds": 80.25,
      "duration_seconds": 13.98,
      "text": "I mean, it usually comes with sudden shortness of breath. And And I've been coughing up a little blood as well, for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.03,
      "end_seconds": 87.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.57,
      "end_seconds": 110.33,
      "duration_seconds": 21.76,
      "text": "Well, I'd say a few times a day. Moderate, really. The sudden shortness of breath? That's been since this morning. And there's a swollen painful calf as well, two weeks now. Well, as for swollen painful calf, Moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.98,
      "end_seconds": 120.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Right, have you had sharp pain when you breathe in before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.98,
      "end_seconds": 129.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "yes, something like this happened about six months ago, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.29,
      "end_seconds": 136.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any wheeze, fever or chest tightness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.19,
      "end_seconds": 142.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "No, you know, no wheeze, fever or chest tightness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.4,
      "end_seconds": 145.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.83,
      "end_seconds": 149.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.31,
      "end_seconds": 158.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.06,
      "end_seconds": 162.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "yes, milk i get a rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.89,
      "end_seconds": 180.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.6,
      "end_seconds": 187.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, heart failure. Thin bones, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.04,
      "end_seconds": 188.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.24,
      "end_seconds": 196.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.28,
      "end_seconds": 205.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.86,
      "text": "hm, okay okay, I can see heart failure and thin bones in your file as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.39,
      "end_seconds": 223.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.0,
      "end_seconds": 229.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 231.78,
      "end_seconds": 243.14,
      "duration_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "I mean, doctor, I think the last prescription for the alendronate was 140 milligrams we changed it at the last visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.6,
      "end_seconds": 249.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Hm, that's different. Is the latest prescription anywhere near you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.49,
      "end_seconds": 254.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.32,
      "end_seconds": 258.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.04,
      "end_seconds": 263.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "so, my mother had a stroke"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.58,
      "end_seconds": 283.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.41,
      "end_seconds": 288.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "no, um, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.51,
      "end_seconds": 297.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.53,
      "end_seconds": 310.84,
      "duration_seconds": 11.31,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I've never touched a cigarette. My husband and I live above the shop. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.27,
      "end_seconds": 314.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.47,
      "end_seconds": 330.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.56,
      "end_seconds": 351.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.65,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 92 beats a minute, SpO2 93 percent on room air. And respiratory rate 23, pressure 139 over 87, temperature 36.8."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.86,
      "end_seconds": 354.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.31,
      "end_seconds": 359.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.1,
      "end_seconds": 365.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.11,
      "end_seconds": 369.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.73,
      "end_seconds": 391.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "Your left calf is swollen and and tender, and your oxygen is lower than I'd like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.96,
      "end_seconds": 394.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.73,
      "end_seconds": 425.49,
      "duration_seconds": 27.76,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Okay, so my impression is this: It's hard to say. A possible blood clot in the lung is one possibility and a chest infection another, and I'd rather not commit yet. I'm sending you for a D-dimer blood test because of possible clot. I want a CT scan of the chest done, that's for breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.11,
      "end_seconds": 427.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 428.89,
      "end_seconds": 440.91,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "You need to go to hospital now for a scan. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.47,
      "end_seconds": 443.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "yes, will do"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.67,
      "end_seconds": 446.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "We'll catch up straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 450.16,
      "end_seconds": 452.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.7,
      "end_seconds": 457.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 457.84,
      "end_seconds": 461.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.56,
      "end_seconds": 465.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "alright, have a good day"
    }
  ]
}